<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-765] Upgrade Avro to 1.8.1</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-765</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Unit test failure occurs if using Avro 1.8.1:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;[ERROR] Failed to execute goal org.apache.avro:avro-maven-plugin:1.8.1:idl-protocol (schemas) ... 
org.apache.avro.compiler.idl.ParseException: Encountered &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot; &quot;&lt;/span&gt;date&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot; &quot;&lt;/span&gt;date &quot;&quot; at line 23, column 14.
[ERROR] Was expecting one of:
[ERROR] &amp;lt;IDENTIFIER&amp;gt; ...
[ERROR] &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;@&quot;&lt;/span&gt; ...
[ERROR] &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;`&quot;&lt;/span&gt; ...
[ERROR] -&amp;gt; [Help 1]
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-1924&quot; title=&quot;Variable named &amp;#39;date&amp;#39; in IDL&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;AVRO-1924&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;AVRO-1924&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; about the background.&lt;br/&gt;
It is not clear whether it is solvable on Avro side or it is more a limitation from Avro 1.8.1. Therefore, I would suggest fixing the issue in the unit test side. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
